{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51038","headline":"禅诗 三 · 无名僧","name":"禅诗 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心平不用持戒，行直河须座。\n恩则普同妇子，义则上下漠然。\n苦口则是凉药，依●定出黄莲。\n菩萨向心如觅，天堂即在眼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}